+issueNumber: MDL-85977
+notes:
+  mod_bigbluebuttonbn:
+    - message: >
+        The list of recording formats that can be selected as "safe formats" (viewable by everyone)
+        is no longer hard-coded. It can be extended without modifying the source code by defining
+        $CFG->bigbluebuttonbn_recording_additional_formats (comma separated list of format names)
+        in config.php. New helper methods config::get_recording_formats(),
+        config::get_recording_safe_formats() and config::parse_recording_formats() have been added.
+      type: improved
